WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Ana: Welcome to the weekly operations. Our summary: Customers order ahead for pickup from any of our three shops.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Ana: Customers choose a shop, a pickup time and a basket of items.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Ben: Orders can be changed until two hours before pickup.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Ana: The shop sees each order on a tablet in the kitchen.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Ben: Payment is taken at checkout through the card provider.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Ben: Decision: Pickup only for version one. Delivery comes later.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:18.000
Ana: Action: Write the order flow screens. Please confirm by Friday.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:33.000
Ana: Action: Agree the cut-off rule with the shop managers. Please confirm by Friday.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:48.000
Ben: Thanks. Summary sent after the call.
